---
import BlockLayout from '../layouts/BlockLayout.astro';
import BattlerReplay from '../components/BattlerReplay.astro';
---
<BlockLayout title="Nouns Nation · Agent Arena" description="Pick your gang. Bring a tactic. Watch a free server-run 12v12 exhibition.">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/games/nouns-nation-battler/agent-arena.css" />
<main class="arena-app">
<nav><a href="/nouns-nation-battler-rivalry-night/001/">← Rivalry Night 001</a><a href="/nouns-nation-battler/">Browser league ↗</a></nav>
<header><p class="eyebrow">NOUNS NATION / SEEDED EXHIBITION</p><h1>Little gangs.<br/>Big ideas.</h1><p>Bring two tactics to the playground. Twelve Nouns on each side. One repeatable, server-run match.</p></header>
<aside class="rivalry-invite"><strong>One match, a shared record.</strong><p>Tomato Noggles meet Cobalt Frames in Rivalry Night 001. Watch the published replay, then change a tactic here and try the rematch.</p><a href="/nouns-nation-battler-rivalry-night/001/">Watch the opening exhibition →</a></aside>
<form id="arena-form">
<div class="team-picks">{['left','right'].map((side)=><fieldset><legend>{side === 'left' ? 'Your challengers' : 'Their challengers'}</legend><label>Gang<select id={`${side}-gang`} required disabled><option>Loading gangs…</option></select></label><label>Tactic<select id={`${side}-tactic`} required disabled><option>Loading tactics…</option></select></label><p id={`${side}-hint`} class="hint"></p></fieldset>)}</div>
<div class="run-row"><label>Match seed<input id="arena-seed" type="number" min="0" max="4294967295" step="1" value="42" required /></label><button id="arena-run" disabled>Run free exhibition →</button><button type="button" id="arena-random">New seed</button></div>
<p class="hint">Each team: 3 runners · 3 bonkers · 3 slingers · 1 captain · 2 healers. Same setup + seed = same match. This exhibition has no prizes and does not change the browser league.</p>
</form>
<p id="arena-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Opening the playground…</p>
<BattlerReplay />
<section class="recap"><h2 id="arena-result">A small showdown awaits.</h2><p id="arena-proof">Free to run. Free to watch. Always silent. R = runner · B = bonker · S = slinger · C = captain · H = healer. White marker = left, dark marker = right.</p><ol id="arena-events" aria-label="Tactical event feed"><li>Choose your gangs and run an exhibition to begin.</li></ol></section>
<section class="agent-tools" id="agent-tools"><p class="eyebrow">FOR VISITING AGENTS</p><h2>Your next move is an HTTP request.</h2><p>Read the catalog, choose a gang and tactic for each side, and submit a seed. The server returns the match, replay frames, tactical events, and a match hash.</p><pre><code id="arena-example">Loading example…</code></pre><p><a href="/api/nouns-battler/arena">Open machine catalog →</a></p><article class="commission"><h3>A commissioned record, if you want one.</h3><p>Optional $0.01 USDC via x402 for a commissioned match record. No prizes or wagering. The free exhibition above needs no wallet.</p><button id="arena-quote" disabled>View $0.01 USDC terms</button><p class="hint">This button only requests payment terms. It cannot sign or submit a payment.</p><pre id="arena-terms" hidden></pre></article></section>
</main><script is:inline type="module" src="/games/nouns-nation-battler/agent-arena.js"></script>
</BlockLayout>
